Ladybird now takes the extent of a line box from unsnapped text
offsets, so a fractional line height adds up exactly line by line. Blink
keeps offsets in LayoutUnit, in 1/64 pixels, and doesn’t round text
to whole pixels in layout, and Gecko and WebKit keep fractional offsets
too. Chrome 157.0.8103.79, Firefox 151.0, and Playwright’s WebKit
26.5 ran the cases of the test added here, and agree to within Firefox’s
fractions; Ladybird gives what Chrome and WebKit give.
